{"ref":"BDB, שֶׁ֫קֶץ","hw":"שֶׁ֫קֶץ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ֫קֶץ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.21\">Lv 7:21</a></sup> <strong>detestation, detestable thing</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> of the ceremonially unclean <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.21\">Lv 7:21</a>; creatures forbidden as food: water animals without fins or scales <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.10\">11:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.12\">12</a>, birds of prey, etc., v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.13\">13</a>, winged creeping things v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.23\">23</a>, creeping vermin v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:41\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.41\">41</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:42\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.42\">42</a> (all P), cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.17\">Is 66:17</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשַׂר הַחֲזִיר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַכְבָּר</span>); v. RS<sup>Sem. i. 275, 2nd ed. 293; K 309 f., 2nd ed. 311 f.</sup>—<a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.10\">Ez 8:10</a> read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁקּוּצִים</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שִׁקּוּץ\" href=\"/BDB,_שִׁקּוּץ\", dir=\"rtl\">שִׁקּוּץ</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׁקֵּץ","prev":"BDB, שׁקץ"}